$ floe check head.yaml
exit 1
--- stderr
head.yaml:1:11: the page drawn from this file has no </head> where a <style> styles the page, before which floe puts the page's styles: page.html writes it in the head, outside {{if}}, {{with}}, {{range}}, <template>, <svg> and <math>, and nothing drawn before it, a part or an item of format html, leaves an element open
